{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C1\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C4\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C4\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2最均衡，把起初的悬而未决、对现状的抗拒、害怕投入后的失去，以及旧感回返后的前行犹疑接成了完整的心理因果链；C3较紧凑但时间层次略有混杂，C4内容完整却过度贴着珠子描写，C1则漏掉了不甘心让现状继续这一重要动机。keep：C4最完整地保留了不知道在等什么、也不知道往哪里去，以及不甘心照旧却又害怕投入失去别的东西这两层；C2次之，C3再次，C1没有明确保留对现状的抗拒。cover：C2最能解释悬而未决、尚未恢复、旧感回返和想挺住又想停下这些感受为何同时存在；C4覆盖面也广，但身体反应写得太像在复述珠子；C1能接住未缓过神和旧感回返，C3对恍惚未醒的状态交代较少。lean：C2的心理步骤衔接最顺，重复虽有但基本都在推进；C3较简洁，却把旧感回返提前放进开头，又把难堪单独拆成一步；C1有一条游离的独立句，C4则对身体反应和心理判断解释得过多。plain：C1最像一个人在讲自己的事，怕一松劲就垮下去、确信也靠不住，都具体而自然；C3次之，C2的本该如此带有较明显的抽象判断色彩，C4的值不值得冒险和刚才的判断则更像分析性的概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "de9ea8b4-2313-4f3f-8914-f542f2d64cd8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T013053795412Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.156, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:32:02.958354+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8f131ad75ceaa5d216e1434636f57376389c8c054e31022817cb1c7b06ea4a9c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib